  <p>
    <strong>Binance Labs is a chain-agnostic investor and incubator focused on supporting the global blockchain ecosystem and decentralized web. Their portfolio includes 1inch, Audius, Axie Infinity, Chiliz, Elrond, Injective, Matic / Polygon, Sandbox and Terra.</strong>
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Ken Li is an Investment Director at Binance Labs, with a focus on equity & token investments in Web3 social, gaming & crypto adoption platforms. He recently joined the Bitcoin.com News Podcast to talk about the market:
  </p>
  
  <div id="buzzsprout-player-9687252">
  </div></p> 
  
  <p>
    <img decoding="async" loading="lazy" class="aligncenter wp-image-498868" src="https://technologymanias.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/ken-li.jpg" alt="Binance Investment Director Ken Li Talks About Investing in Web3, Gaming and More Exciting Trends" width="158" height="158" />
  </p>
  
  <p>
    Ken also helps lead the Binance incubation program. Prior to Binance, Ken led blockchain investment & incubation strategy at BCG Digital Ventures and started his career as a management consultant at Bain.
  </p>
  
